# `self` in an @as list is the checkpoint, never a group: a keyword group
# named `self` is the group of no @as.
# error: keyword group `self` is the group of no @as
@lexer
tokens
    ident, eof, err
[a-z]+                                      → ident
.                                           → err

@parser
@keywords
    self  if

@as IDENT = [self]

prog! = IDENT*
